    0.05
   ],
   "src": "css4",
   "at": "Overview.bs:5759-5768 #interpolation-alpha",
   "quote": "<div class=\"example\" id=\"ex-premultiplied-lab\">\nTo interpolate, in the Lab color space, the two colors\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(76%, 62%, 03%, 0.4)\"></span> rgb(76% 62% 03% / 0.4)\nand\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(91.56%, 3.87%, 74.09%, 0.6)\"></span> color(display-p3 0.84 0.19 0.72 / 0.6)\nthey are first converted to lab\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(76%, 62%, 03%, 0.4)\"></span> lab(66.927% 4.873 68.622 / 0.4)\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(91.56%, 3.87%, 74.09%, 0.6)\"></span> lab(53.503% 82.672 -33.901 / 0.6)\nthen the L, a and b coordinates are premultiplied before interpolation\n[26.771% 1.949 27.449]"
  },
  {
   "id": "css4-0204",
   "kind": "explicit-statement",
   "input": "color(display-p3 0.84 0.19 0.72 / 0.6)",
   "expected": "lch(53.5% 89.35 337.7 / 0.6)",
   "precision": [
    0.05,
    0.005,
    0.05,
    0.05
   ],
   "src": "css4",
   "at": "Overview.bs:5779-5788 #interpolation-alpha",
   "quote": "<div class=\"example\" id=\"ex-premultiplied-lch\">\nTo interpolate, in the chroma-preserving LCH color space, the same two colors\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(76%, 62%, 03%, 0.4)\"></span> rgb(76% 62% 03% / 0.4)\nand\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(91.56%, 3.87%, 74.09%, 0.6)\"></span> color(display-p3 0.84 0.19 0.72 / 0.6)\nthey are first converted to LCH\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(76%, 62%, 03%, 0.4)\"></span> lch(66.93% 68.79 85.94 / 0.4)\n<span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: rgb(91.56%, 3.87%, 74.09%, 0.6)\"></span> lch(53.5% 89.35 337.7 / 0.6)\nthen the L and C coordinates (but not H) are premultiplied before interpolation\n[26.771% 27.516 85.94]"
  },
