   "src": "css4",
   "at": "Overview.bs:6410-6420 #css-gamut-mapping",
   "quote": "<div class=\"example\" id=\"ex-p3-oog-canvas\">\nFor example, given a 2d context\nwith colorSpace set to \"display-p3\"\nand colorType set to \"unorm8\";\nattempting to paint the color oklch(76% 0.27 60)\nwill trigger gamut mapping,\nbecause once converted to Display P3,\nthe value color(display-p3 1.062 0.4954 -0.3115)\nhas a red coordinate greater than 1 and a negative blue coordinate.\nGamut mapping will produce a similar, but lower chroma,\ncolor, such as <span class=\"swatch\" style=\"--color: #ff8900\"></span>&nbsp;color(display-p3 1 0.546 0)."
  },
